 *   **Degenerate Input:** If $\eta = 0$ (uniform distribution), the kernel size is maximized ($k_i \approx C_k$). If $\eta = 1$ (high frequency), the kernel size is minimized ($k_i \approx C_k(1-\alpha)$) [S1].
 
